# Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project provides an interactive Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard to help businesses monitor performance, identify trends, and generate insights from sales data.

## Objectives
- Analyze sales and revenue data
- Track key business KPIs
- Identify top-performing products
- Monitor revenue trends
- Support data-driven decision making

## Key Features
- Total Sales KPI
- Total Revenue KPI
- Total Orders KPI
- Average Order Value
- Monthly Revenue Trend Analysis
- Top Performing Products
- Sales by Category
- Region-wise Sales Analysis
- Interactive Filters and Slicers

## Dashboard Components

### KPIs
- Total Sales
- Total Revenue
- Total Orders
- Average Order Value

### Visualizations
1. Revenue Trend (Line Chart)
2. Sales by Product (Bar Chart)
3. Sales by Category (Pie Chart)
4. Top Products Analysis
5. Region-wise Sales Comparison
6. Monthly Sales vs Revenue

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Power BI
- Data Visualization Techniques

## Business Insights
- Identify revenue growth trends
- Track best-selling products
- Compare regional performance
- Improve strategic decision-making

## Expected Outcome
The dashboard enables efficient KPI tracking, business performance monitoring, and insight generation through interactive visualizations.

